   $q$The prefix trans- means "across," and the root port means "carry." What did the riders do when they would "transport the mail"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They wrote letters by hand to send to their families","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"context-only-guess"},{"text":"They sorted the mail into piles inside a train car","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"They carried the mail from one town across to another","is_correct":true},{"text":"They read every letter before they gave it to people","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-root-clues"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They carried the mail from one town across to another$q$, $q$Transport means "carry across," and the riders carried the mail from one town to the next in a leather bag. Sorting mail in a train car was done later by other workers.$q$, 'draft', '41a3f180-57f4-5623-b390-bf2fa443eedc')
