   $q$The suffix -less means "without." What kind of dog is a "fearless dog"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A dog that is very fast on a bicycle","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"context-only-guess"},{"text":"A dog that has no owner to care for it","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-root-clues"},{"text":"A dog that is brave and without fear","is_correct":true},{"text":"A dog that is scared of most things","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A dog that is brave and without fear$q$, $q$Fearless means "without fear," so the dog is brave. A dog that is scared of things would be fearful, the opposite.$q$, 'draft', '8810dbb2-7977-552a-9fa2-57b075d92206')
