   $q$What is the author's main point?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Farmers in Harlow Falls sent grain to the city by wagon.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The railroad was the reason Harlow Falls grew into a busy town.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"},{"text":"Harlow Falls opened its first library in the year 1832.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The canal was the reason Harlow Falls grew into a busy town.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The canal was the reason Harlow Falls grew into a busy town.$q$, $q$The author says "The reason, I believe, was the Harlow Canal," and every paragraph after that backs it up. The railroad is the other side that the author answers at the end.$q$, 'draft', 'e1cc7c38-cd05-57a1-a30c-2f08d06954e6')
