   $q$The students in Carver City measured sidewalk temperatures. Which point does their measurement support?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Trees drop leaves on sidewalks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"},{"text":"Trees trap dust from the air.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Trees help people save money.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Trees cool the area around them.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Trees cool the area around them.$q$, $q$The shaded sidewalk was 89 degrees while the sunny one was 128, which shows trees cool things down. The measurement says nothing about money or electricity.$q$, 'draft', '98c2fc6a-c533-5793-8309-0f64488ef78e')
