   $q$How are the answers to the two mysteries different?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In Text 1 an outside visitor caused the problem; in Text 2 the person with the problem caused it herself.","is_correct":true},{"text":"In Text 1 the blamed boy really did cause the problem; in Text 2 the blamed boy did not cause it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"In both texts the mystery is never fully solved, so the reader must decide what happened.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-resolution"},{"text":"In Text 1 the person with the problem caused it herself; in Text 2 an outside visitor caused the problem.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-texts"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In Text 1 an outside visitor caused the problem; in Text 2 the person with the problem caused it herself.$q$, $q$A cat came in through the window in Text 1, but in Text 2 Grandma says "The thief was me!" Both mysteries are solved, so the reader does not have to guess.$q$, 'draft', '6ad249e6-b949-50a9-ab83-9f89be88b3e8')
